Appendix 1:


                      Support and Updates



If you wish to purchase 4D-BBS, please send your mailing address and
$49.95* in US FUNDS, in the form of check or money order (checks made
payable to Cornerstone Software) to one of the below adresses.
Washington state residence MUST add 8% sales tax to the above price.

Upon receiving your order, you will be mailed one 3.5 inch diskette
containing full-working version of 4D-BBS and a registration form.
The manual will also accompany the diskette in hard copy form, but
is also on the diskette itself.

It is important that once you receive your copy of 4D-BBS, the
registration form be filled out.  This will give you access to updates
of 4D-BBS, which are available for downloading from the 4D-BBS support
library on both 4D-BBS support bulletin boards.

For more information contact on of the 4D-BBS support sites listed
